<BRK/>
<TXT>The dry FGD system design shall be such that the electrical equipment shall perform satisfactorily in the ambient environment of [_____] to [_____] <MET>
 degrees C</MET><ENG> degrees F</ENG> and [_____] to [_____] percent relative humidity.</TXT><BRK/>
