[_____]].  The steam generator is [a new] [an existing] [pulverized coal-fired] [spreader stoker-fired] [underfeed stoker-fired] boiler.  Operating 
conditions for each steam generator at its maximum rating are:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Type firing [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
