<ITM>Count (<RID>ASTM D3775</RID>)</ITM><BRK/>
<ITM>Yarn Weight (<RID>ASTM D578/D578M</RID>)</ITM><BRK/>
<ITM>Fabric Treatment Content</ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>The fabric shall meet the following specifications.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TAB HEADERROWS="0" WIDTH="57">
